        "TileImage": "$($repository 14a2717b-e183-4626-acf8-ce7a866d00c1).Image",
        "Description": "Good day, Agent. \r\rOur client at Villa Caruso has identified five employees whose productivity no longer justifies their continued employment. Rocco’s tardiness, along with his colleagues’ habitual gossip and smoking breaks, has reduced output while labour costs remain unchanged.\r\rEliminate all five designated personnel. Their duties will be redistributed among the remaining staff without additional compensation.\r\rGood luck.\r\rCreator - blythe",
